---
import '../styles/global.css';
import ProjectGallery from '../components/ProjectGallery';
import Contact from '../components/Contact';
import ThemeToggle from '../components/ThemeToggle';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#eeeee7"><meta name="description" content="An independent designer's collection of thoughtful digital experiences and visual identities."><title>Alex Morgan — Independent designer</title></head>
<body><a class="skip" href="#work">Skip to work</a><header><a class="wordmark" href="#" aria-label="Alex Morgan home">am<span>®</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">Work <sup>04</sup></a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#contact">Let’s talk <span>↗</span></a></nav><ThemeToggle client:load /></header>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> INDEPENDENT DESIGNER & CREATIVE PARTNER</div><h1>Good design.<br><span class="second-line">A little <em>feeling.</em><svg class="asterisk" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 3v94M3 50h94M17 17l66 66M17 83l66-66"/></svg></span></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>I turn complex ideas into clear, considered<br class="desktop"> digital experiences. Made with purpose.<br class="desktop"> And a little personality.</p><a class="round-link" href="#work"><span>EXPLORE SELECTED WORK</span><b>↘</b></a></div><div class="hero-foot"><span>BASED ANYWHERE. WORKING EVERYWHERE.</span><span>SCROLL TO DISCOVER ↓</span></div></section>
<ProjectGallery client:load />
<section id="about" class="about section"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE PIXELS</span><div class="about-mark" aria-hidden="true">a<span>m.</span><small>ALWAYS CURIOUS.</small></div></div><div class="about-copy"><h2>A clear head.<br>An open mind.<br><em>A considered approach.</em></h2><p>I’m Alex, an independent designer interested in the space where strategy meets feeling. I believe the best work is simple enough to understand, and distinctive enough to remember.</p><p>From a first sketch to the final interaction, I bring care, curiosity, and a collaborative spirit to every detail.</p><div class="capabilities"><span>Digital design</span><span>Visual identity</span><span>Creative direction</span><span>Web development</span></div><small class="sample-note">Sample profile — replace with your own story.</small></div></section>
<section class="process section"><span class="eyebrow">03 / HOW I WORK</span><div class="process-list"><details open><summary><span>01</span>Start with a conversation.<b>+</b></summary><p>Good work starts with good questions. We explore your ambition, your audience, and what a meaningful outcome looks like.</p></details><details><summary><span>02</span>Find the essential.<b>+</b></summary><p>Ideas become a clear creative direction. Through sketches, visual explorations, and prototypes, we find what makes your story distinct.</p></details><details><summary><span>03</span>Make every detail count.<b>+</b></summary><p>We refine the visuals, build the experience, and test the small things—from the way it moves to the way it feels on a phone.</p></details></div></section>
<Contact client:load /></main><footer><a class="wordmark" href="#">am<span>®</span></a><span>© <span>{new Date().getFullYear()}</span> ALEX MORGAN · DEMO PORTFOLIO</span><a href="#">BACK TO TOP ↑</a></footer>
<script>
if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
 const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => entries.forEach(entry => { if (entry.isIntersecting) { entry.target.classList.add('visible'); observer.unobserve(entry.target); } }), { threshold: 0.08 });
 document.querySelectorAll('.about-copy,.process-list').forEach(element => { element.classList.add('reveal'); observer.observe(element); });
}
</script></body></html>
